  "description": "In Hwayeon Kingdom, there is a guardian god called 'Garden' that has served the king for generations. Legend has it that a king who is loved by the guardian god will live forever, so many kings long for the love of Garden. Bodyguard Black Young, who admires Garden, begins to gradually become greedy for it...\n\n(Source: Mr.Blue, translated)\n\n *Note: Part of Peanutoon's Geosi, Girong Danpyeonseon (거시,기록 단편선) Collection.*",
